# Left out of `git archive`, which is what GitHub's tarball and zip downloads —
# and therefore `nix run github:...` and `nix flake` inputs — are built from.
# None of it is needed to build or run `domain`: the binary embeds only the
# top-level docs and the editor extension files. Tests and research material
# stay in the repository; they just are not shipped.
#
# `*_test.go` and the testdata directories are a deliberate trade: a download
# cannot run `go test`. Clone the repository for that.
/selfhost          export-ignore
/docs/superpowers  export-ignore
/bench             export-ignore
/testdata          export-ignore
/codegen/testdata  export-ignore
/docs/testdata     export-ignore
*_test.go          export-ignore
